earch<span class="font-normal text-secondary-foreground">. Extract, Deep Research, and other APIs have their own rate limits.<!-- --> <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary font-medium underline hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors duration-150" href="https://docs.octen.ai/resources/rate-limits">See rate limits</a>.</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-[#f3f3f2] content-stretch flex flex-col gap-7 sm:gap-9 items-center py-12 sm:py-22.5 relative shrink-0 w-full" id="faq-section"><div class="text-center flex flex-col gap-3 px-4 max-w-200"><h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.5rem] text-fg-strong leading-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="text-[1rem] text-fg-tertiary">If you have any questions about using Octen, feel free to email us at<!-- --> <a href="mailto:support@octen.ai" class="text-primary font-medium underline hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors">support@octen.ai</a>.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-328 w-full px-4 box-border items-start" data-name="Container (FAQ 1312px 2-Col Grid)"><div class="relative rounded-lg w-full transition-all duration-200 ease-out box-border flex flex-col border bg-[#eaebeb] border-[rgba(26,26,25,0.12)] hover:bg-white hover:border-[#B5B5B0] hover:shadow-[0_0.25rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-0" class="w-full bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between p-[0.875rem_1.25rem] sm:p-[1rem_1.25rem] text-left gap-3 select-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#039855] focus-visible:outline-none rounded-lg"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-center"><p class="font-semibold text-fg-body text-base leading-[1.35] m-0">How is Octen billing calculated?</p></div><div class="relative rounded-full shrink-0 size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-[#ebebeb]"><svg class="size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out rotate-0" style="transform-origin:center center" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4.16667V15.8333M4.16667 10H15.8333" stroke="#0E0E0E" stroke-width="1.66667"></path></svg></div></button><div id="faq-answer-0" role="region" aria-label="How is Octen billing calculated?" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0"><p class="font-normal leading-[1.6] text-fg-secondary text-[0.875rem] sm:text-[1rem] border-t border-[rgba(26,26,25,0.08)] pt-3">Octen combines real-time pay-as-you-go API credits with an optional monthly QPS Plan. Usage is deducted from your balance as you call the APIs. The QPS Plan reserves search throughput — it does not include usage credits, and every account starts on the free tier.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-lg w-full transition-all duration-200 ease-out box-border flex flex-col border bg-[#eaebeb] border-[rgba(26,26,25,0.12)] hover:bg-white hover:border-[#B5B5B0] hover:shadow-[0_0.25rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1" class="w-full bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between p-[0.875rem_1.25rem] sm:p-[1rem_1.25rem] text-left gap-3 select-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#039855] focus-visible:outline-none rounded-lg"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-center"><p class="font-semibold text-fg-body text-base leading-[1.35] m-0">Is the $5 free balance automatic?</p></div><div class="relative rounded-full shrink-0 size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-[#ebebeb]"><svg class="size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out rotate-0" style="transform-origin:center center" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4.16667V15.8333M4.16667 10H15.8333" stroke="#0E0E0E" stroke-width="1.66667"></path></svg></div></button><div id="faq-answer-1" role="region" aria-label="Is the $5 free balance automatic?" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0"><p class="font-normal leading-[1.6] text-fg-secondary text-[0.875rem] sm:text-[1rem] border-t border-[rgba(26,26,25,0.08)] pt-3">Yes. New accounts automatically receive $5 in free balance upon registration — no credit card or manual claim required to start testing API requests.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-lg w-full transition-all duration-200 ease-out box-border flex flex-col border bg-[#eaebeb] border-[rgba(26,26,25,0.12)] hover:bg-white hover:border-[#B5B5B0] hover:shadow-[0_0.25rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2" class="w-full bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between p-[0.875rem_1.25rem] sm:p-[1rem_1.25rem] text-left gap-3 select-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#039855] focus-visible:outline-none rounded-lg"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-center"><p class="font-semibold text-fg-body text-base leading-[1.35] m-0">How do Prompt Cache discounts work for Model Gateway?</p></div><div class="relative rounded-full shrink-0 size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-[#ebebeb]"><svg class="size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out rotate-0" style="transform-origin:center center" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4.16667V15.8333M4.16667 10H15.8333" stroke="#0E0E0E" stroke-width="1.66667"></path></svg></div></button><div id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-label="How do Prompt Cache discounts work for Model Gateway?" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0"><p class="font-normal leading-[1.6] text-fg-secondary text-[0.875rem] sm:text-[1rem] border-t border-[rgba(26,26,25,0.08)] pt-3">Cached system prompt tokens receive up to 90% discount on cache reads for supported models via Model Gateway, significantly lowering long-context synthesis costs.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative rounded-lg w-full transition-all duration-200 ease-out box-border flex flex-col border bg-[#eaebeb] border-[rgba(26,26,25,0.12)] hover:bg-white hover:border-[#B5B5B0] hover:shadow-[0_0.25rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3" class="w-full bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between p-[0.875rem_1.25rem] sm:p-[1rem_1.25rem] text-left gap-3 select-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#039855] focus-visible:outline-none rounded-lg"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-center"><p class="font-semibold text-fg-body text-base leading-[1.35] m-0">Can I upgrade or scale my QPS plan at any time?</p></div><div class="relative rounded-full shrink-0 size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-[#ebebeb]"><svg class="size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out rotate-0" style="transform-origin:center center" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4.16667V15.8333M4.16667 10H15.8333" stroke="#0E0E0E" stroke-width="1.66667"></path></svg></div></button><div id="faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-label="Can I upgrade or scale my QPS plan at any time?" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0"><p class="font-normal leading-[1.6] text-fg-secondary text-[0.875rem] sm:text-[1rem] border-t border-[rgba(26,26,25,0.08)] pt-3">Yes. Upgrades take effect immediately with prorated billing. Downgrades take effect at the start of your next billing cycle.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="rela